{"product_id":"the-scorch-trials","title":"The Scorch Trials","description":"\u003cp\u003eSolving the Maze was supposed to be the end. No more puzzles. And no more running. Thomas was sure that escaping meant he would get his life back. But no one knew what sort of life they were going back to...Burned and baked, the earth is a wasteland, its' people driven mad by an infection known as the Flare.Instead of freedom, Thomas must face another trial. He must cross the Scorch to once again save himself and his friends...\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43691081629849,"sku":"15RB-4-9781906427795","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67a256c6b8f6c_The_20Scorch_20Trials_20James_20Dashner.jpg?v=1738755363","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-scorch-trials","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}